s Stable Drivers:** Notice the slightly tighter bounds and minor shifts in the median positions within the **Copy Number Alteration (CNA)** and **METHYLATION** distributions. This indicates that major structural DNA shifts and broad epigenetic silencing exert a more measurable influence on overall drug distribution profiles than transient transcriptomic variations (**GENE_EXPR**).\n","* **The Phenotypic Overrides the Genotypic:** Ultimately, the wide vertical spread (the extensive whiskers and outliers) within *every single category* proves that cancer drug sensitivity is an emergent, multi-factorial trait. A single mutation or expression change is rarely enough to drive resistance or sensitivity on its own. Instead, a cell's therapeutic fate is determined by a complex combination of its anatomical tissue origin and broader pathway mechanics, which we mapped out in the sections above.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"xsflJ_tdsalY"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def compute_effect(data, feature, pos_label='Y', neg_label='N'):\n","    effect = (\n","        data\n","        .groupby([\"DRUG\", feature])[\"IC50\"]\n","        .median()\n","        .unstack()\n","    )\n","\n","    # Handle missing columns\n","    if pos_label in effect.columns and neg_label in effect.columns:\n","        effect[\"diff\"] = effect[pos_label] - effect[neg_label]\n","    else:\n","        effect[\"diff\"] = None\n","\n","    return effect[\"diff\"]"],"metadata":{"id":"YUaXcY2Olxle","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789217782237,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":46,"user":{"displayName":"Himabindu Kumdam","userId":"05411869555977081730"}}},"execution_count":55,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["cna = compute_effect(gdsc, \"CNA\")\n","msi = compute_effect(gdsc, \"MSI_STATUS\", pos_label='MSI-H', neg_label='MSS/MSI-L')\n","expr = compute_effect(gdsc, \"GENE_EXPR\")\n","meth = compute_effect(gdsc, \"METHYLATION\")"],"metadata":{"id":"CADh2atSp_eP","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":